WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.850
Beat the pain, by walking.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:15.850
Paper. Phone calls. Spreadsheets. Information scattered across systems.

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.850
Now, one system for the whole clinic.

4
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.850
AposCRM.

5
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:24.900
The morning starts on one dashboard.

6
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.900
A diary by therapist, room and branch.

7
00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.900
Who has arrived, and who is already in treatment.

8
00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.900
One search, and the patient card is open.

9
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.900
Every record, under its own problem.

10
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.900
Every gait measure, against the norm.

11
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.900
A locked PDF, and a Word file to edit.

12
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:45.900
From the first enquiry to a patient.

13
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.900
Landing pages by drag and drop, on mobile too.

14
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.900
Quotes and treatment packages.

15
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.900
A personal portal, with a one time code.

16
00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.900
Every call, linked to the card.

17
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:01.850
Ninety-seven screens. One system.

18
00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:08.140
Every route is checked, two step sign in, and every view is logged.

19
00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:13.900
A full backup every night, and a restore that has actually been tested.

20
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:23.850
AposCRM. Now live.
